In 2023, Fox and Wigderson \cite[Lemma 2.3]{FW2023} provided an improvement of Lemma \ref{lem-lem6} by proving that 
if $k\ge 2, \alpha >0$ and $G$ is an $n$-vertex graph with $ \delta (G) \ge (1- \frac{2}{2k-1} + \alpha )n$, 
