+The paper studies the signless Laplacian Q(G)=D(G)+A(G), its Perron
+eigenvalue q(G), and complete multipartite/Turan graphs.  This module presents
+a relabelled complete multipartite graph and asks for q(G) as an exact real
+algebraic number.  The graph is assembled from its independent twin classes;
+the minimal polynomial follows from the equitable quotient and the matrix
