codex
The bare harness could not reach any oracle: OpenRouter returned HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded (total limit)” on every redraw, so the script correctly refused to manufacture a hardness verdict. I’ll finish the locally verifiable module, report, and documentation while preserving that script-owned failure evidence; the three oracle arms remain explicitly pending rather than being claimed as passes.
apply patch
