+NOTES = (
+    "Section 1.3 defines Q(G)=D(G)+A(G), q(G), and the Q-spectral "
+    "extremal problem. Section 1.1 defines complete multipartite Turan "
+    "graphs, and Section 2.1/Theorem 2.4 make clique blowups central native "
+    "objects. Section 3, especially Algorithm 1 in the proof of Theorem 3.3, "
+    "explicitly obtains Perron eigenvectors mechanically; this rules out an "
+    "honest Track-A claim here and motivates Track B. Instances use six "
