codex
The first run found a performance bug in the audit itself, not the family: G4 was revalidating graph symmetry 200,000 times before rejecting random polynomials. I stopped it and am memoizing only graph-derived invariants, while keeping every candidate-specific polynomial and Sturm check exact.
apply patch
