codex
The measured compact-route counter initially came to 317 because it charged multiplication by the monic factor’s coefficient \(1\) and coefficient copies as arithmetic. I replaced that with the actual monic-linear recurrence; the audited route is now 254 exact additions/multiplications, with the same polynomial and certificate, under the 300-operation cap.
