Implemented a self-contained Track B generator for exact signless-Laplacian spectral radii, using the paper’s native \(Q(G)=D+A\) object and complete multipartite graphs. The paper’s blowup theorem is asymptotic with hidden finite constants, so the prior planted-\(K_4[t]\) proposal was not used as theorem-backed generation. [Paper full text](https://arxiv.org/html/2507.02263v2)

